# Bob's chicken biryani (for the team dinner)

- 1 kg chicken, 750 g sella rice (soaked 30 min)
- 3 onions fried golden, 4 tomatoes, 1 cup yoghurt
- biryani masala, ginger-garlic paste, green chillies, mint, coriander
- saffron in warm milk, kewra water

Cook the chicken korma-style until oil separates. Boil rice with whole spices to 70 %. Layer rice–chicken–rice, top with fried onions, mint, saffron milk. Dum on the lowest heat 20 minutes with a heavy lid.
